1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,531
Your AI agent shouldn't live on someone

2
00:00:02,531 --> 00:00:03,664
else's computer.

3
00:00:03,964 --> 00:00:05,364
Meet OpenBots.

4
00:00:05,664 --> 00:00:06,622
An agent you own,

5
00:00:06,622 --> 00:00:08,188
that lives in your texts.

6
00:00:08,338 --> 00:00:09,297
Just message it.

7
00:00:09,297 --> 00:00:10,910
It searches, sets reminders,

8
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:12,381
and gets things done.

9
00:00:12,431 --> 00:00:14,773
Pick the model behind every part.

10
00:00:14,773 --> 00:00:17,227
OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, xAI,

11
00:00:17,227 --> 00:00:19,150
or one running locally.

12
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,842
It all runs on your machine.

13
00:00:20,842 --> 00:00:21,508
Your keys.

14
00:00:21,508 --> 00:00:23,399
Your messages never leave it.

15
00:00:23,449 --> 00:00:25,064
It can even use your computer,

16
00:00:25,064 --> 00:00:27,301
and asks before anything it can't undo.

17
00:00:27,951 --> 00:00:29,172
And it answers only you,

18
00:00:29,172 --> 00:00:30,681
and the people you allow.

19
00:00:30,731 --> 00:00:32,359
Set it up from one dashboard.

20
00:00:32,909 --> 00:00:33,565
OpenBots.

21
00:00:33,565 --> 00:00:34,423
Open source.

22
00:00:34,423 --> 00:00:35,733
Own your agent.
